Neither imports the other; there is no shared package, no root workspace, no src/index.ts and
no utils module. A diff that edits files in BOTH codelines for a single story, or that adds a
cross-package import, is a blocker — the two stories are independent and each is confined to
its own package. Tests live in `test/`, one file per source module, importing via a relative
path with no extension (`from '../src/fares'`). Both packages are `"type": "module"`.

VERIFICATION COMMANDS (run from inside the affected package directory):

